{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"16ded5dc4e2ddb729010e3886586b1a875952506b8d309b0047c2ac2b798eef4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华说：「到那时，人必将犹大王的骸骨和他首领的骸骨、祭司的骸骨、先知的骸骨，并耶路撒冷居民的骸骨，都从坟墓中取出来，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["抛散在日头、月亮，和天上众星之下，就是他们从前所喜爱、所事奉、所随从、所求问、所敬拜的。这些骸骨不再收殓，不再葬埋，必在地面上成为粪土；"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["并且这恶族所剩下的民在我所赶他们到的各处，宁可拣死不拣生。这是万军之耶和华说的。」"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"heading","content":["罪与罚"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"你要对他们说，耶和华如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人跌倒，不再起来吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人转去，不再转来吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这耶路撒冷的民，为何恒久背道呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们守定诡诈，不肯回头。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我留心听，听见他们说不正直的话。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人悔改恶行，说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我做的是什么呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们各人转奔己路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如马直闯战场。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"空中的鹳鸟知道来去的定期；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"斑鸠燕子与白鹤也守候当来的时令；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的百姓却不知道耶和华的法则。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"你们怎么说：我们有智慧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的律法在我们这里？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，文士的假笔舞弄虚假。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"智慧人惭愧，惊惶，被擒拿；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们弃掉耶和华的话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心里还有什么智慧呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我必将他们的妻子给别人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将他们的田地给别人为业；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们从最小的到至大的都一味地贪婪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从先知到祭司都行事虚谎。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们轻轻忽忽地医治我百姓的损伤，说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"平安了！平安了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其实没有平安。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们行可憎的事知道惭愧吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不然，他们毫不惭愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不知羞耻。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此他们必在仆倒的人中仆倒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我向他们讨罪的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必致跌倒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：我必使他们全然灭绝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"葡萄树上必没有葡萄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无花果树上必没有果子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叶子也必枯干。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我所赐给他们的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必离开他们过去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"我们为何静坐不动呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们当聚集，进入坚固城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在那里静默不言；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华—我们的 神使我们静默不言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又将苦胆水给我们喝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都因我们得罪了耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们指望平安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却得不着好处；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"指望痊愈的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不料，受了惊惶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"听见从但那里敌人的马喷鼻气，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的壮马发嘶声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全地就都震动；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们来吞灭这地和其上所有的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞灭这城与其中的居民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"看哪，我必使毒蛇到你们中间，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是不服法术的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必咬你们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米为同胞悲伤"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"我有忧愁，愿能自慰；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我心在我里面发昏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"听啊，是我百姓的哀声从极远之地而来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"说：耶和华不在锡安吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"锡安的王不在其中吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：他们为什么以雕刻的偶像","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和外邦虚无的神惹我发怒呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"麦秋已过，夏令已完，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们还未得救！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知说：因我百姓的损伤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也受了损伤。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我哀痛，惊惶将我抓住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"在基列岂没有乳香呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在那里岂没有医生呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我百姓为何不得痊愈呢？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}